[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892269\">7055B43</a></p><p>1. Working inside the bumper, rotate the rear sensor concerned (which\nhas a bayonet fitting) in a clockwise direction.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a, 2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890725\">K97A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890728\">K97D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. If necessary, remove the bush from the bumper from the outside.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035507.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not\ndamaged.</p><p>If removed, fit the bush on the bumper.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit the sensor in the housing and rotate\nit.</p><p>Check sensor operation</p><p><a href=\"#/2892269\">7055B43</a></p>"]]